      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After using eat strength on strength path immortal material, the rise in strength path dao marks is only small. Fang Yuan notes that refining snack Immortal Gu into rank seven Big Snack would let him modify eat strength so the gain becomes more evident. He uses the move again in that stretch of cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        1467
